<title>USA: Isuzu September US truck sales rise.</title>
<headline>Isuzu September US truck sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Isuzu Motors Ltd</p>
<p>			Sep 1-30, 1996     Sep 1-30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car		   0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	   7,607	     5,399	    +46.8</p>
<p> Import Car		     1		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p> Import Truck	     1,104	     6,105	    -81.2</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Sep 30, 1996 Jan 1-Sep 30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car		   0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  54,876	    45,777	    +19.4</p>
<p> Import Car		     1		  13	    -92.3</p>
<p> Import Truck	    16,266	    29,816	    -45.7</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 24 in latest month vs 25, 231 for year to date vs 230 in year ago.</p>
</text>
